 edge_src="First principles: reversal of price-insensitive settlement flow. 2bps is ~16% of the 60min majors std.",
 vol_src="Measured: 60min majors-basket std 12.5bps.",
 falsifier="The 20:00-21:00 return shows no negative autocorrelation with the subsequent overnight return.",
